    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295081,295131</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>フラムベルクと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What to do with Flamberg?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292976</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>また、おまえたちか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, it's you again...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293092</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この前は……
ごめんなさい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>About before...
Um, I'm sorry.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293092</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>結局、怒れる大地の復活を
阻止することはできなくて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We couldn't stop the revival of
the Raging Earth after all...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>で、でも、
『不燃の古木』を盗んだのは
オレらじゃねーぞ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>B-But, we weren't the
ones who stole the
"Unburning Oldwood"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わかっている。
あの時のことはもういい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I know. There is nothing more
to say about that time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なるようになったのは、
もはや宇宙の因果</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What will be, will be. Some things
are simply the way of this universe.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おそらく貴様らの背負った業が
なすべくしてなしたもの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's quite likely this is the
result of your karma, and
what must follow from it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや……
それで今日は私に
何か用があってのことか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, that aside... Is there
some purpose for which
you've come to me today?</EnglishText>
      <Notes>need checked in game. Would be weird if she repeated herself twince like this, but I want to see context for the repeat line. -dragon
</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293468</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今日は私に何の用だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>With what purpose have
you come to me today?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この私に戦いを？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>To battle me?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいだろう、
しかし、傷つき倒れても、
文句は受け付けぬぞ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Fine. But, I will not accept
your complaints, should it
end in your injury and defeat.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>では……参る！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then... Let us begin!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293700</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>無念……私の負けだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mortifying... It's my loss.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293700</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふっ……傷つき倒れるのは
私のほうだったか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ha... So I am the one suffering
both injury and defeat.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293860</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>フラムベルク！
オレらに力を貸してくれ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Flamberg! Lend us your power!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>焔王の眷属である私に
力を貸せと？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You ask this of me, a retainer
of the Flame Lord?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は我が主以外の者とは
契約せぬ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I will form no pact with
any outside my master.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが、どうやら、
貴様には降魔術士の力が
備わっているようだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Though, it appears you
have attained the power
of a Fallen Wizard.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいだろう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Fine...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>貴様の持つマテリアル、
黒檀を契約の証とし、
我が力を貸し与えん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The material you hold, Ebony.
With it as proof of our pact,
I lend my power unto you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>4</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294244</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我、今、焔の王の眷属に
ねがいたてまつる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here and now, I offer my request
to the Retainer of the Lord of Flame.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294244</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>偉大なる者の盟約のもと、
我に彼の者を従わせたまえ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>By covenant of the Great One,
may they obey me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294244</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我が名は&lt;Dio&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My name is &lt;Dio&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この炎の剣で、貴様らの障害を
焦がし尽くしてくれよう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>With this flaming sword, I will
burn away all obstacles to you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は焔王に仕える者。
たかが人間ごときに
我が力扱えぬ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I am an attendant of the
Lord of Flame. No mere
human can wield my power.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
